247
00:14:15,900 --> 00:14:18,277
Unless his strategy kicks
in, now he's finished!

248
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:20,777
Something strange is
going on in this duel.

249
00:14:20,860 --> 00:14:22,440
Yeah, this seems too easy.

250
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:25,237
Or Yugi's fighting the
world's worst duelist.

251
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:28,397
Well, either way, Yugi's gonna
win this thing in his next turn.

252
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:30,186
Time to make your final move.

253
00:14:33,180 --> 00:14:34,360
All right, then.

254
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:40,880
It's time.

255
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:44,260
You've done exactly
what I wanted you to do.

256
00:14:44,620 --> 00:14:46,780
Now your destruction begins.

257
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,360
It's over.

258
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:49,710
Over?

259
00:14:49,793 --> 00:14:50,640
Yeah, for him.

260
00:14:51,260 --> 00:14:53,997
Yugi's got this clown set up like
a balloon on a thought board.

261
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:54,910
It's a bluff.

262
00:14:54,993 --> 00:14:55,940
It has to be.

263
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,617
He's got no monsters left.

264
00:14:57,700 --> 00:15:00,840
And he's already down to
less than 500 life points.

265
00:15:01,520 --> 00:15:03,597
There'd be no point in bluffing now.

266
00:15:03,680 --> 00:15:05,617
But Korra must have
something up his sleeve.

267
00:15:05,700 --> 00:15:07,620
A plan to turn the tables.

268
00:15:07,960 --> 00:15:12,313
I hold a card in my hand with dark
powers beyond your wildest imagination.

269
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:18,460
But first, before I could play this
all-powerful card, I needed a bit of assistance.

270
00:15:18,980 --> 00:15:20,980
Thanks for helping me destroy you.

271
00:15:21,460 --> 00:15:23,937
Three of my monsters
needed to be destroyed

272
00:15:24,020 --> 00:15:26,777
before I could bring
forth my dark destructor.

273
00:15:26,860 --> 00:15:28,684
Master, you made that possible.

274
00:15:29,820 --> 00:15:33,840
Now I summon the beast that will
cause your demise, Dark Necrophair.

275
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:35,550
Ugh.

276
00:15:38,460 --> 00:15:41,720
You have no idea what you
are about to experience.

277
00:15:47,980 --> 00:15:50,039
I knew you were planning something.

278
00:15:51,860 --> 00:15:52,690
It doesn't matter.

279
00:15:52,773 --> 00:15:57,011
You still fell into my trap, and now
you're about to pay the ultimate price.

280
00:15:58,820 --> 00:15:59,840
This is it.

281
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:02,380
You're finished, Yugi. What is it?

282
00:16:02,800 --> 00:16:04,920
That monster's creeping me out.

283
00:16:05,220 --> 00:16:06,440
Me too, Tristan.

284
00:16:06,620 --> 00:16:09,957
And if he was willing to lose all
those life points to bring it out,

285
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:11,380
it must be powerful.

286
00:16:11,780 --> 00:16:15,077
Dark Necrofear is one of the most
destructive cards in my deck.

287
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:16,395
You'll never stop it.

288
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:19,120
I know a card in Yugi's deck that can.

289
00:16:19,920 --> 00:16:23,420
His Egyptian god card, the
mighty Slifer, the Sky Dragon.

290
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:27,880
It all depends on whether or not
Yugi has the courage to use it.

291
00:16:27,980 --> 00:16:29,820
Stare into the face of defeat.

292
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:33,920
You see, not only is my monster strong,

293
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:37,677
possessing more attack points
than either of your monsters,

294
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:40,642
but it also possesses a
dark magic hidden within,

295
00:16:40,860 --> 00:16:42,980
waiting to activate and destroy you.

296
00:16:43,220 --> 00:16:46,396
Your monster may be powerful,
but it's not unbeatable.

297
00:16:47,140 --> 00:16:50,477
This dark Necrofear must
possess incredible powers

298
00:16:50,560 --> 00:16:53,877
If Bakura risked losing the
finals just to summon it

299
00:16:53,960 --> 00:16:57,137
He led Yugi through this
duel like a dog on a leash

300
00:16:57,220 --> 00:17:00,680
And now Bakura has him
exactly where he wants him So,

301
00:17:00,900 --> 00:17:02,488
what will you do now, Yugi?

302
00:17:03,740 --> 00:17:08,300
I'm not ready to attack
yet So, I will end my turn

303
00:17:10,040 --> 00:17:11,760
Why didn't he attack me?

304
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:14,477
His monster could easily
destroy my Magnet Warrior

305
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:17,501
or my Gazelle and seriously
damage my life points.

306
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:19,977
Is he worried about my face down card?

307
00:17:20,060 --> 00:17:22,420
Or is it something else? Make your move.

308
00:17:22,540 --> 00:17:26,537
When I'm ready, you were foolish enough
not to attack me when you had the chance.

309
00:17:26,620 --> 00:17:30,080
Now you shall pay the
price as I draw this.

310
00:17:30,860 --> 00:17:31,690
Awesome.

311
00:17:31,773 --> 00:17:34,220
This card will destroy his dark necrofear,

312
00:17:34,460 --> 00:17:36,857
allowing me to wipe out the
rest of his life points.

313
00:17:36,940 --> 00:17:38,780
It's time to win this duel.

314
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:41,882
I sacrifice Gazelle, the
king of mythical beasts,

315
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:47,520
in order to summon my Dark Magician Girl.

316
00:17:55,240 --> 00:18:00,280
Fool, I'm afraid your magical fairy
is too weak to destroy my monster.

317
00:18:01,060 --> 00:18:02,120
That's true.

318
00:18:02,520 --> 00:18:05,814
But apparently you've forgotten
about my face down card.

319
00:18:06,140 --> 00:18:07,960
It looks like you're the fool.

320
00:18:08,320 --> 00:18:10,480
Behold my magic formula card.

321
00:18:12,840 --> 00:18:13,670
No!

322
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:21,260
Yes, Magic Formula raises Dark Magician
Girl's attack power by 500 points,

323
00:18:21,880 --> 00:18:25,180
making her more powerful
than your Necrofear.

324
00:18:26,140 --> 00:18:27,260
Yeah, attaboy!

325
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:29,640
Put that big creep six feet under!

326
00:18:29,800 --> 00:18:34,600
And now, attack his Necrofear
with Dark Burning Attack!

327
00:18:40,080 --> 00:18:40,910
Thanks.

328
00:18:41,040 --> 00:18:44,099
Once again, you've done
exactly what I wanted, Yugi.

329
00:18:44,200 --> 00:18:48,318
Don't you realize that I've manipulated
every move you've made so far?

330
00:18:48,420 --> 00:18:50,940
Including destroying Dark Necrofear.

331
00:18:51,140 --> 00:18:52,660
So I can play this.

332
00:18:55,540 --> 00:18:56,640
What's going on?

333
00:18:56,760 --> 00:18:59,537
Watch as the entire playing
field is engulfed in

334
00:18:59,620 --> 00:19:02,980
a shroud of dark magic
known as Dark Sanctuary.

335
00:19:08,740 --> 00:19:09,570
Yeah!

336
00:19:09,653 --> 00:19:10,600
It's the evil eyes!

337
00:19:10,840 --> 00:19:11,899
I don't like this.

338
00:19:12,380 --> 00:19:13,640
Look around you.

339
00:19:13,860 --> 00:19:17,940
There's no escaping the magic
of Dark Sanctuary. Well done.

340
00:19:18,340 --> 00:19:22,917
Everything had to go just right for this
to work and you played your part perfectly.

341
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:23,830
Now what?

342
00:19:24,220 --> 00:19:25,140
Just wait.

343
00:19:25,580 --> 00:19:29,020
You have no idea what you've
just helped me to unleash.

344
00:19:29,460 --> 00:19:32,989
Prepare to experience an evil
like you've never seen before.

345
00:20:04,720 --> 00:20:05,550
Thank you.
